      "left": 480,
      "top": 384.6643569553805,
      "content": "Diatrez o'smalari",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "maxCharacters": 10,
      "elementIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "type": "shape",
      "width": 324.5370078740157,
      "height": 106.71905511811022,
      "left": 635.4629921259842,
      "top": 182.36115485564304,
      "content": "Nerv tizimi o'smalari inson hayotiga jiddiy ta'sir ko'rsatishi mumkin. Ular turli xil simptomlar bilan namoyon bo'lishi va shifokorlar tomonidan to'g'ri tashxis qo'yishni talab qiladi. O'smalarning o'ziga xos belgilarini bilish muhimdir.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "maxCharacters": 246,
      "elementIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "type": "shape",
      "width": 324.5370078740157,
      "height": 95.58414698162728,
      "left": 635.4629921259842,
      "top": 289.08020997375326,
      "content": "O'smalarni davolash usullari orasida jarrohlik, radioterapiya va kimyoterapiya mavjud. Har bir usulning o'ziga xos afzalliklari va kamchiliklari bor. Davolashning samaradorligi o'sma turiga va rivojlanish bosqichiga bog'liq.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "maxCharacters": 246,
      "elementIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "type": "shape",
      "width": 324.5370078740157,
      "height": 103.08062992125983,
      "left": 635.4629921259842,
      "top": 403.8868241469816,
      "content": "O'smalarning oldini olishda sog'lom turmush tarzi, to'g'ri ovqatlanish va muntazam jismoniy faoliyat muhim ahamiyatga ega. Shuningdek, stressni boshqarish va zarur tibbiy tekshiruvlarni o'tkazish ham zarur.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "maxCharacters": 246,
      "elementIndex": 23
    },
